              了解 WEB / Agent 版本
              <svg
                class="w-4 h-4"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                ><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg
